    "description": "Analyze a source file with Tree-sitter and return its structure — functions, classes, imports, and exports with line ranges — WITHOUT reading the full file (40-60% fewer tokens). Languages: ts,js,tsx,py,go,cs,java,kt,rs,php,rb,cpp; exports only for ts,js,tsx,py,go,cs. Use it before reading a file. Prefer an absolute file path; when multiple workspaces are open, either pass an absolute path or set workspaceRoot so a relative path resolves against the intended workspace.",
    "inputSchema": {
