    "description": "List the files that the given file imports (forward dependency edges). Use to understand what a module depends on. The first call starts building the workspace import graph in the background; later calls answer from cache. While it builds (minutes on a large workspace) the result is { status: "building", retryAfterMs }: call again after retryAfterMs. A failed build returns status "failed"; calling again rebuilds. Graph languages: ts,js,tsx,py,go,cs; other files return status "unsupported-language". On very large workspaces the graph is partial: the result then has incomplete: true with graphedFiles and discoveredFiles, and a missing file or empty list is not conclusive.",
