    "description": "Link the calling session (the chat session that makes this call; you never pass a session id) to a task folder under .ptah/specs. The link is stored per user, outside the repository, and does not edit task.md. role is primary or related (default primary); a new primary link demotes the existing one. The task folder is not checked: a missing task shows as missing in the UI. Errors: invalid-args, organization-unavailable (always in VS Code), unattributed-caller (the session has no SDK id yet; retry later), link-failed.",
    "inputSchema": {
